developer as both game (and upcoming novel): every dungeon, every spell, every love scene drawn from the same vision.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREDITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Solas Composer (CC BY). Full credits available on my website's game page. <br>The rest of the game is my own work, as a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TELL ME ABOUT THE GAME WORLD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is an <strong>affirmation of heroic will and true love, against all </strong>dangers and limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caverns and Dryads shows you a world with <strong>danger</strong> and <strong>wonder</strong>, <strong>romance</strong> and <strong>heroism</strong>, and <strong>mythic creatures.</strong> It has its own <strong>lore</strong> and aesthetics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this underground universe, <strong>dryads</strong> and the <strong>Magic Council</strong> play a central role. The shadow of the <strong>Chaotic Invasion</strong> marks their past, and menaces their future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to meet <strong>the Purple King</strong> of the Amethyst Throne, Aubeline <strong>the queen of the dryads</strong>, and many other <strong>unforgettable</strong> <strong>characters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>freely explore and move through the different locations</strong> in the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the main <strong>quests</strong> and accept <strong>jobs</strong> to get gold or just <strong>explore</strong> the world to get experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>actions will advance the story and the relationship between the warrioress and the wizard.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They are heroes: they don't fall easily.</strong> The wizard can resurrect the warrioress, but at a cost that you can recover if you play <strong>wisely</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based 2D action</strong> that's <strong>immersive</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong>, yet <strong>thrilling</strong> during <strong>battles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in short sessions or for hours, immersing yourself in this <strong>fantasy</strong> universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>100% free game.</strong> You can buy the DLCs to get extra content, features and lore, but it's <strong>not</strong> mandatory. If you enjoy the game and want to support my work, you can buy a DLC —it helps me keep expanding this world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/d9238c24c89abdab40a830c748afeca2.avif?t=1787905390\" width=800 height=472 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE COMMUNITY: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I constantly add new content, stories, and features! Caverns and Dryads is a <strong>living, ever‑expanding world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the community</strong> and share your thoughts! Visit the Steam <strong>discussions</strong>, read the <strong>blog</strong>, or drop me a message on <strong>Discord</strong>! (links here or from the game menu)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/c11f6b8bae72f94558605955dafb3e69.avif?t=1787905390\" width=800 height=814 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Guide Tamzyn, the dryad warrioress —deadly and beautiful— and Sioul, the wizard —tenacious and powerful— to explore together forgotten cities of mysterious beauty and d